                                  <span>목표 유효GDD: {provisionData.patentEngine.moduleA_optimalPeriods.s141_crop_temp_params.required_effective_gdd}℃ / 일반GDD(0℃): {provisionData.patentEngine.moduleA_optimalPeriods.s141_crop_temp_params.required_raw_gdd}℃</span>
